---
import { SITE } from '../data';
---

<section id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading" class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8">
	<div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10">
		<h1 id="about-heading" class="display text-[clamp(3.25rem,9vw,5.75rem)] lg:col-span-7">
			One engineer, from the first question to the handover.
		</h1>
		<div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-2 lg:col-span-5 lg:self-end">
			<p>
				{SITE.name} is a founder-led software development and technology consulting practice in
				Vancouver, BC, building web applications, internal tools, APIs and cloud infrastructure.
			</p>
			<p>
				Good software comes from careful engineering, plain communication, and understanding the problem it
				has to solve before writing any of it.
			</p>
			<p class="font-semibold text-ink">
				You work directly with the engineer who builds your software — no account managers, no
				handoffs. The person who scopes your project is the person writing the code, so context stays
				intact and decisions stay fast.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
